Description: VeltOS AI, an assistant pane like Windows 11's Copilot
 A pane on the right edge of the screen (Windows + C) to chat with the AI
 service the user chooses, with the user's own API key: ChatGPT (OpenAI),
 Claude (Anthropic), Gemini (Google) or Copilot through Microsoft's Azure
 OpenAI. Answers stream in, with Markdown.
 .
 VeltOS AI can also act on the computer through a fixed list of actions
 (light/dark mode, volume, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Do not disturb, opening apps,
 Settings pages, folders and web pages, Snipping Tool) and look up the
 PC's details or file names; every change waits for the user's "Allow".
 Messages go only to the chosen service; the key stays on the computer.
